                          "text": [
                            "The Bird Vote",
                            "Small birds have\nscratched the vane\ncrossbar smooth. A\nnotice asks",
                            "residents not to\ntreat their facing\ndirection as a\nforecast. The",
                            "birds have no duty\nto predict\nweather. Moxie\nadded: Neither\ndoes my",
                            "left knee, despite\nseveral confident\nnewspaper\ninterviews."
